 hid-generic 0003:10C4:8105.0001: input,hidraw0: USB HID v1.11 Mouse [YSPRINGTECH USB OPTICAL MOUSE] on usb-1f058000.usb-4/input0

2. ehci-platform loaded before ohci-platform:

